  <!-- SECTION 7: FREQUENTLY ASKED QUESTIONS -->
  <section class="zv-bins-section">
    <h2><span>❓</span> 7. Frequently Asked Questions</h2>

    <details class="zv-bins-faq-item">
      <summary class="zv-bins-faq-summary">How much can one storage bin hold?</summary>
      <div class="zv-bins-faq-answer">
        Each bin provides 210L of volume, holding up to 3 king-size down comforters, 30 puffer jackets, or up to 200 folded shirts and seasonal garments.
      </div>
    </details>

    <details class="zv-bins-faq-item">
      <summary class="zv-bins-faq-summary">Are the handles strong enough for heavy comforters?</summary>
      <div class="zv-bins-faq-answer">
        Yes! The side handles are crafted from wide high-tensile webbing and cross-stitched directly into the reinforced seams to withstand heavy lifting from high shelves.
      </div>
    </details>

    <details class="zv-bins-faq-item">
      <summary class="zv-bins-faq-summary">Are the bins rigid plastic or soft fabric?</summary>
      <div class="zv-bins-faq-answer">
        They are constructed from durable, flexible multi-layer fabric. This allows them to conform smoothly into closets and shelves when packed, and fold completely flat when empty without bulky plastic walls.
      </div>
    </details>

    <details class="zv-bins-faq-item">
      <summary class="zv-bins-faq-summary">Do they protect blankets from dust and moisture?</summary>
      <div class="zv-bins-faq-answer">
        Yes. The high-density woven fabric and zippered perimeter block out household dust, lint, and ambient moisture while preserving healthy air circulation to prevent stale odors.
      </div>
    </details>

    <details class="zv-bins-faq-item">
      <summary class="zv-bins-faq-summary">Can I wash the storage bins?</summary>
      <div class="zv-bins-faq-answer">
        We recommend spot cleaning with a damp cloth and mild soap, then air drying naturally. Do not place in a washing machine or tumble dryer to maintain the structural composite coating.
      </div>
    </details>

    <details class="zv-bins-faq-item">
      <summary class="zv-bins-faq-summary">What is the return policy for this product?</summary>
      <div class="zv-bins-faq-answer">
        All Zavelyn storage organizers are backed by our standard 30-Day Customer Guarantee. If you're not completely satisfied with your home organization setup, return within 30 days under store policy.
